<title>USA: Perry Public School, Mich., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Perry Public School, Mich., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $2.400 million of Perry Public Schools, Mich., general obligation 1997 school building and technology bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.08 percent.</p>
</text>
